    <section><h2>1. Provider and eligibility</h2><p>Kindling is provided by Aftaab Siddiqui and published under Gentleloop Labs. Contact <a href="mailto:hello@maskedsyntax.com">hello@maskedsyntax.com</a>. You must be at least 13, or have permission from a parent or guardian where required.</p></section>
